{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And you shall see on the birth-stools.</b> He gave them a sign: the male, his face is downward, and the female, her face is upward, after the manner of intercourse." "<b>If it is a son, put him to death.</b> When he saw that afflicting them with their burdens was of no avail, as it is written ״וכאשר יענו אותו כן ירבה״ etc., then they took a course to put the sons to death, for it is their way to fight, since they feared war. As it is written ״ונלחם בנו״." "<b>And if it is a daughter, let her live.</b> It is not a woman's way to fight."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:55:43.122968872Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}